    c("6:93", "time-circumstance", {25: "[o sırada]"}, "Idh introduces the death-agony circumstance to be seen; it does not mean the following wrongdoers noun.")
    d("6:93:25", "Make the time/circumstance introducer explicit, leaving the wrongdoers at their own source word.")
    p("6:113", "relative-deeds", [("işle", 12), ("dik", 10), ("leri [suçları]", 12)], "Ma hum muqtarifun identifies what they commit. Expose the Turkish relative ending; crimes remains an explicit explanatory object rather than ma incorrectly pointing only at onların.")
