    p("6:114", "relative-revealer", [("indir", 7), ("en", 6), ("dir", 0)], "Alladhi anzala predicates the one who revealed the book. Turkish indiren is an appropriate relative construction for this completed revelation; the copular ending is shared nominal-predicate support.")
    d("6:114:6", "Restore relative predication rather than hiding the finite/concessive phrase at alladhi.")
    p("6:123", "city-locative", [("her ", 4), ("kent", 5), ("te", 3)], "Fi kulli qaryatin is in every city. Restore the locative rather than a genitive on kentin at both the noun and the preposition view.")
