    d("7:3:13 7:10:10", "After qalilan, ma reinforces the paucity/exclamatory expression under this adopted analysis; ne kadar da az ... already carries it naturally in Turkish. Do not insert a relative object or a second negation.", True)
    p("7:5", "negative-past", [("artık ", 1), ("değil", 1), ("di", 2)], "Fa-ma kana ... illa is the negative past copula in a restriction on their plea. Değildi exposes the copula rather than copying the following plea noun.")
