    d("7:38:9 7:57:22 7:179:5 7:188:17", "Retain the separately inspected class/content phrases: jinn and human communities, varieties of fruit, many jinn/people, or much good acquired. Turkish expresses these with uninflected nouns/quantifiers in the inherited frame; an additional physical-source ablative is not required.", True)
    p("7:39", "negative-existence", [("öyleyse ", 4), ("yok", 4), ("tur", 5)], "Fa-ma kana negates an advantage in the reported dispute. Turkish yoktur fuses absence and copula; expose -tur at kana, with fa at the preceding source word.")
